  "description": "The Vaporesso Xros 5 is a feature-packed pod vape kit designed to deliver precision control and lasting performance for both MTL (mouth-to-lung) and RDL (restricted direct-to-lung) vaping styles. Its sleek aluminium alloy build houses a powerful 1500mAh battery and a bright 0.88” HD screen that gives you instant access to battery life, power level, and customisable settings including six dynamic UI themes. With three selectable output modes—ECO, Normal, and Power—the Xros 5 lets you tailor your vaping experience to your preferences. The intuitive side-mounted airflow slider allows you to shift effortlessly between a tight MTL draw and a looser RDL inhale. Dual activation options (auto-draw and button fire) add to the device’s user-friendly appeal. Each kit includes two mesh pods: a 0.6ohm pod for a slightly airier vape and a 0.8ohm pod for a more restricted draw. Both pods use Vaporesso’s upgraded COREX 2.0 heating tech, enhancing flavour consistency and extending coil lifespan. The Xros 5 is compatible with the full XROS pod series and charges rapidly via USB-C with up to 3A input, keeping downtime to a minimum. Whether you’re upgrading from a basic pod system or looking for a refined portable kit, the Vaporesso Xros 5 combines control, flavour and reliability in one compact device. We recommend pairing the included pods with the following E-Liquid: RDL Xros Series 0.6ohm Mesh Pod with 50/50 or Nic Salt E-Liquid MTL Xros Series 0.8ohm Mesh Pod with 50/50 or Nic Salt E-Liquid Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil. Vaporesso Xros 5 Pod Vape Kit",
